<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand says reference rate 29.075.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand says reference rate 29.075.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Thursday announced the weighted average interbank exchange rate was 29.075 per dollar against 29.096 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The reference rate is the average rate traded the previous day. It has been announced daily by the central bank since last week's managed flotation of the baht.</p>
<p>The baht was quoted at 29.00/29.10 onshore and 28.80/29.00 in offshore markets early on Wednesday..</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
